to-be-incorporated-into-paper-114 : List Word
to-be-incorporated-into-paper-114 = unlines (cons "- **The hyperactive tool takes the choices that should not be choices** (Avik, 2026-11-14, “Avik's words, verbatim” (AI-AGENTS-WELCOME-TO-HYPERACTIVITY.md)). An agent entering the repository is not given free rein to read, grep and run" (cons "  anything in no guaranteed order, with a README that may or may not be followed. Its only access" (cons "  point is the `hyperactive` command, which delivers onboarding as a deterministic sequence of turns:" (cons "  the documents first, then the core code every collaborator holds in initial context. Then the" (cons "  `hyperactive` order says which tasks may be taken up. Reading code is a query by term and relation," (cons "  with no file or position concept, and relevant information comes with every query; writing is a" (cons "  `hyperactive` action too. None of this is represented as a file system. This is a general" (cons "  principle and high priority: the discipline of the tool, like the rules of the task graph, is what" (cons "  gives the system its value." nil)))))))))
